// Actor documents holding every top-level member each server's actor serializer writes, as its source at the named
// version renders it (a member it writes only on a condition, such as movedTo, included), for the inventory of the
// view Fedify is handed (remote-actor-view.test.ts, "hands Fedify only the inventory"). Values are placeholders of the
// rendered shapes; only the members matter there.

